    <string name="rewards_title">Reward Assistant</string>
    <string name="rewards_honesty_title">How rewarded ads really work</string>
    <string name="rewards_honesty_1">Rewards (extra lives, coins, bonuses) are granted by the game developer, not by AdVault.</string>
    <string name="rewards_honesty_2">AdVault cannot fake, skip or complete a rewarded ad, and never will. Many games verify the ad view with the ad network\'s server.</string>
    <string name="rewards_honesty_3">Blocking ads usually makes rewarded ads unavailable, so rewards that depend on them cannot be earned.</string>
    <string name="rewards_honesty_4">Choosing “Allow rewarded ads” excludes the game from AdVault so you can decide to watch them. Other ads in that game will show too.</string>
